pport for<br>
=C2=A0 =C2=A0TLS 1.2 cipher suites exclusively through ClientHello.client_h=
ello<br>
=C2=A0 =C2=A0improves the interoperability in the installed base and use of=
 TLS<br>
=C2=A0 =C2=A01.2 AEAD cipher suites without upsetting the installed base of=
<br>
=C2=A0 =C2=A0version-intolerant TLS servers, results in more TLS handshakes=
